OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to thwart speeding not
OL,4,Aenough, say campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a city suburb are
OL,7,Fconcerned new plans to tackle dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving in their community will not be
OL,9,Fenough.
OL,11,FResidents in Lakenham, Norwich, said
OL,12,Fthey have been left "unsettled" by how
OL,13,Ffast some drivers travel along roads in
OL,14,Fthe area.
OL,16,FTheir comments came after Norfolk
OL,17,FCounty Council put forward plans to
OL,18,Finstall traffic-calming measures along
OL,19,FHall Road.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
